{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08858","headline":"寄远十一首 一 · 李白","name":"寄远十一首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三鸟别王母，衔书来见过。\n肠断若剪弦，其如愁思何。\n遥知玉窗里，纤手弄云和。\n奏曲有深意，青松交女萝。\n写水山井中，同泉岂殊波。\n秦心与楚恨，皎皎爲谁多。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08858.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08858","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}